# xr_dms

A lazy, chunked implementation of the Data Mining Sharpener

## Installation

```bash
pip install xr_dms
```

## Development

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest
```

## Release

```bash
./tag_release.sh patch   # or minor / major
```
